Subject: [PATCH 2/6] W3C_XML.parse reads strings and bytes through one
 implementation that parses the DOCTYPE, keeps comments and instructions
 before the root in prologue (now [Content]) and refuses anything but comments
 and instructions after the root (swift-w3c/swift-w3c-xml#7)

